      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{l} \\text {设椭圆上点的坐标为} (x,y,z), \\text {则目标函数} d^{2}=x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}, \\text {约束条件：} z-x^{2}-y^{2}=0 \\text { 和} \\\\ x+y+z-1=0.\\text {构造函数} \\\\ F=x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}+\\lambda(z-x^{2}-y^{2})+\\mu(x+y+z-1), \\\\ \\{\\begin{array}{l} 2x-2\\lambda x+\\mu=0, \\\\ 2y-2\\lambda y+\\mu=0, \\\\ 2z+\\lambda+\\mu=0, \\\\ z=x^{2}+y^{2}, \\\\ x+y+z=1, \\end{array} \\\\ \\text {解方程组} \\\\ \\text {得} x=y=\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{3}}{2}, \\ z=2-\\sqrt{3}, \\ x=y=\\frac{-1-\\sqrt{3}}{2}, \\ z=2+\\sqrt{3}. \\text {根据题意可知，此最大及最小距离} \\\\ \\text {都存在，故最大与最小值必分别在这两点计算，得到} d_{\\max}=\\sqrt{9+5\\sqrt{3}}, \\quad d_{\\min}=\\sqrt{9-5\\sqrt{3}}. \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{l} \\text {设椭圆上点的坐标为} (x,y,z), \\text {则目标函数} d^{2}=x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}, \\text {约束条件：} z-x^{2}-y^{2}=0 \\text { 和} \\\\ x+y+z-1=0.\\text {构造函数} \\\\ F=x^{2}+y^{2}+z^{2}+\\lambda(z-x^{2}-y^{2})+\\mu(x+y+z-1), \\\\ \\{\\begin{array}{l} 2x-2\\lambda x+\\mu=0, \\\\ 2y-2\\lambda y+\\mu=0, \\\\ 2z+\\lambda+\\mu=0, \\\\ z=x^{2}+y^{2}, \\\\ x+y+z=1, \\end{array} \\\\ \\text {解方程组} \\\\ \\text {得} x=y=\\frac{-1+\\sqrt{3}}{2}, \\ z=2-\\sqrt{3}, \\ x=y=\\frac{-1-\\sqrt{3}}{2}, \\ z=2+\\sqrt{3}. \\text {根据题意可知，此最大及最小距离} \\\\ \\text {都存在，故最大与最小值必分别在这两点计算，得到} d_{\\max}=\\sqrt{9+5\\sqrt{3}}, \\quad d_{\\min}=\\sqrt{9-5\\sqrt{3}}. \\end{array}</div>"
